            </h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
              Sometimes. A few hundred dollars above this bracket buys
              meaningfully wider incline ranges and stronger motors on
              select machines, like the NordicTrack Commercial 1750. If
              your budget has any flexibility and you specifically want
